---
// Implicit Go interfaces (no 'implements'), safe type assertion (v, ok), and type-safe generics.
const W = 900;
const H = 282;
---
<figure class="gf2d">
  <div class="gf2d-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Implicit interface satisfaction in Go without an implements keyword alongside safe comma-ok type assertions and cmp.Ordered generics.">
      {/* Left panel: Implicit Satisfaction */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="424" height="254" rx="10" class="gf2d-card is-ok" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf2d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Implicit Interfaces (Static Duck Typing)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Interface ngầm định (Không cần từ khóa implements)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="184" height="90" rx="6" class="gf2d-box" />
      <text x="42" y="80" class="gf2d-b">type Reader interface</text>
      <text x="42" y="100" class="gf2d-m">Read(p []byte)</text>
      <text x="42" y="116" class="gf2d-m">  (n int, err error)</text>
      <text x="42" y="138" class="gf2d-b-ok">1 method contract!</text>

      <line x1="252" y1="105" x2="220" y2="105" class="gf2d-wire-ok" />
      <polygon points="214,105 222,100 222,110" class="gf2d-head-ok" />

      <rect x="256" y="60" width="166" height="90" rx="6" class="gf2d-box is-ok" />
      <text x="268" y="80" class="gf2d-b-ok">*os.File / *bytes.Reader</text>
      <text x="268" y="100" class="gf2d-m">Defines Read(p []byte)</text>
      <text x="268" y="118" class="gf2d-m">→ satisfies io.Reader</text>
      <text x="268" y="138" class="gf2d-b">automatically!</text>

      <rect x="30" y="164" width="392" height="88" rx="6" class="gf2d-box" />
      <text x="44" y="186" class="gf2d-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Small interfaces unlock painless mocks &amp; reuse:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Interface càng nhỏ càng dễ viết test &amp; ghép nối:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="206" class="gf2d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Define interfaces in caller package, not the producer.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đặt interface ngay bên gọi — không ép struct gốc biết trước.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="226" class="gf2d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Tiny contracts (io.Reader, error) compose smoothly in stdlib.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Interface 1–2 hàm (io.Reader, error) ghép cực mượt với stdlib.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: Type assertions & Generics */}
      <rect x="458" y="14" width="428" height="254" rx="10" class="gf2d-card" />
      <text x="474" y="42" class="gf2d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Safe Type Assertions &amp; Generics [T cmp.Ordered]</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Ép kiểu an toàn (v, ok) &amp; Generics kiểu chuẩn</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="474" y="60" width="396" height="58" rx="6" class="gf2d-box is-red" />
      <text x="488" y="80" class="gf2d-b-red">Unsafe: f := r.(*os.File)  // PANICS if r wraps bytes.Buffer!</text>
      <text x="488" y="99" class="gf2d-b-ok">Safe:   if f, ok := r.(*os.File); ok {'{'} ... {'}'}  // OR switch v := x.(type)</text>

      <rect x="474" y="128" width="396" height="58" rx="6" class="gf2d-box is-ok" />
      <text x="488" y="148" class="gf2d-b-ok">Generics (Go 1.18+): func Max[T cmp.Ordered](a, b T) T</text>
      <text x="488" y="167" class="gf2d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Reuse math/collection logic over types with compile-time safety.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng chung logic trên int, float64, string — compiler kiểm kiểu.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="474" y="196" width="396" height="56" rx="6" class="gf2d-box" />
      <text x="488" y="216" class="gf2d-b">Interface vs. Generics rule of thumb:</text>
      <text x="488" y="235" class="gf2d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Behavior differs → Interface. Same logic across types → Generic [T].</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khác hành vi (DB/Mock) → Interface. Giống logic → Generic [T].</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Any concrete type implementing a matching method signature satisfies a Go interface implicitly; combine safe type switches with [T cmp.Ordered] generics to eliminate unchecked "any" casts.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chỉ cần định nghĩa đúng chữ ký hàm là một kiểu tự khớp với Interface mà không cần từ khóa implements; kết hợp ép kiểu hai vế (v, ok) với Generics giúp code gọn mà không mất an toàn kiểu tĩnh.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf2d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf2d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf2d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf2d text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf2d-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf2d-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf2d-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf2d-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf2d-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gf2d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf2d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf2d-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf2d-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf2d-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf2d-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf2d-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf2d-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf2d-wire-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .gf2d-head-ok { fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf2d-wire-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf2d-head-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf2d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
